<h1>HTML ASSIGNMENT – PROGRAMS WITH ANSWERS</h1>
<p><strong>Name:</strong> Keerthana</p>
<p><strong>Subject:</strong> HTML</p>

<hr>

<h2>1. Basic Paragraph</h2>
<pre>
&lt;p&gt;This is my first paragraph in HTML.&lt;/p&gt;
</pre>

<h2>2. Multiple Paragraphs</h2>
<pre>
&lt;p&gt;HTML is used to structure web pages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CSS is used to style web pages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;JavaScript adds interactivity.&lt;/p&gt;
</pre>

<h2>3. Line Break</h2>
<pre>
Hello&lt;br&gt;World
</pre>

<h2>4. Bold Text</h2>
<pre>
&lt;b&gt;This is bold text&lt;/b&gt;
</pre>

<h2>5. Strong Text</h2>
<pre>
&lt;strong&gt;Important text&lt;/strong&gt;
</pre>

<h2>6. Italic Text</h2>
<pre>
&lt;i&gt;Italic text&lt;/i&gt;
</pre>

<h2>7. Emphasized Text</h2>
<pre>
&lt;em&gt;Emphasized text&lt;/em&gt;
</pre>

<h2>8. Underlined Text</h2>
<pre>
&lt;u&gt;Underlined text&lt;/u&gt;
</pre>

<h2>9. Marked Text</h2>
<pre>
&lt;mark&gt;Highlighted text&lt;/mark&gt;
</pre>

<h2>10. Small Text</h2>
<pre>
&lt;small&gt;Smaller text&lt;/small&gt;
</pre>

<h2>11. Deleted Text</h2>
<pre>
&lt;del&gt;Deleted text&lt;/del&gt;
</pre>

<h2>12. Inserted Text</h2>
<pre>
&lt;ins&gt;Inserted text&lt;/ins&gt;
</pre>

<h2>13. Subscript</h2>
<pre>
H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O
</pre>

<h2>14. Superscript</h2>
<pre>
2&lt;sup&gt;3&lt;/sup&gt; = 8
</pre>

<h2>15. Horizontal Rule</h2>
<pre>
&lt;hr&gt;
</pre>

<h2>16. Link</h2>
<pre>
&lt;a href="https://www.google.com"&gt;Visit Google&lt;/a&gt;
</pre>

<h2>17. Open Link in New Tab</h2>
<pre>
&lt;a href="https://www.wikipedia.org" target="_blank"&gt;Wikipedia&lt;/a&gt;
</pre>

<h2>18. Image</h2>
<pre>
&lt;img src="image.jpg" alt="Sample Image" width="200"&gt;
</pre>

<h2>19. Math Formula</h2>
<pre>
a&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt; + b&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt; = c&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt;
</pre>

<h2>20. Chemistry Formula</h2>
<pre>
CO&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt; + H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O
</pre>

<h2>21. Combination of Formatting Tags</h2>
<pre>
&lt;b&gt;Bold&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;Italic&lt;/i&gt; &lt;mark&gt;Mark&lt;/mark&gt;
&lt;del&gt;Old&lt;/del&gt; &lt;ins&gt;New&lt;/ins&gt;
</pre>

<h2>22. Email Link</h2>
<pre>
&lt;a href="mailto:info@example.com"&gt;Send Email&lt;/a&gt;
</pre>

<h2>23. Abbreviation</h2>
<pre>
&lt;abbr title="World Health Organization"&gt;WHO&lt;/abbr&gt;
</pre>

<h2>24. Quotation</h2>
<pre>
&lt;q&gt;Practice makes perfect&lt;/q&gt;
</pre>

<h2>25. All Tags Example</h2>
<pre>
&lt;b&gt;HTML&lt;/b&gt; is &lt;em&gt;easy&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;mark&gt;important&lt;/mark&gt;
H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O , x&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt;
</pre>

<hr>

<p><strong>END OF HTML ASSIGNMENT</strong></p>

